# Normalize line endings so a clone is byte-identical on Windows, macOS and Linux.
# Without this, core.autocrlf rewrites files at checkout on Windows and every
# `npm run format` produces a whole-repo diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
